We need to provide a glossary of terms related to waste storage (probably waste management, disposal, landfill, etc.) in New Zealand. Provide terms in Kyrgyz perhaps with explanations in Kyrgyz, maybe also English. Provide safe, helpful answer. No disallowed content. So just create glossary.

We should ensure accuracy. Provide terms like "Landfill", "Resource Recovery", "Hazardous Waste", "Ecosite", "Waste Minimisation", "EPA", "Local Authority", "Waste Management Plan", "Zero Waste", "Marae", maybe "Rimu", not needed. Provide definitions. Possibly include relevant legislation: "Resource Management Act", "Waste Minimisation Act", "Hazardous Substances and New Organisms Act". Provide agencies: "Ministry for the Environment", "Environmental Protection Authority (EPA)", "Regional Councils". Provide types of waste: "Municipal Solid Waste (MSW)", "Industrial Waste", "Construction and Demolition (C&D"}

